Explicitly excluded: hyper-compress-wasm and Kura (separately licensed by the
BentoPDF authors; not redistributed here). At upstream v2.8.10 no source file
imports hyper-compress-wasm (grep of src/ and package.json/package-lock.json
finds none); only the kura.html and hyper-compress.html marketing pages exist,
and scripts/build-local.sh deletes them from the bundle and fails the build if
they or the string "hyper-compress-wasm" reappear (scripts/check-dist.sh).
Links to those pages from navbar/legal pages are not removed.

No release artifact ships until every NEEDS REVIEW line above is resolved.

Corresponding source for any distributed artifact: this repository at the
commit recorded in the bundle's SOURCE.txt, plus the pinned upstream BentoPDF
tag and commit recorded in UPSTREAM_VERSION and UPSTREAM_COMMIT. Every built
bundle contains SOURCE.txt, LICENSE and this NOTICE.
